v-m\">天然卫星；卫星；人造卫星</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">衛生</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えいせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">卫生；清洁；厕所；卫生间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"188967\"><ruby>衛生<rp>(</rp><rt>えいせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>用品<rp>(</rp><rt>ようひん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>場<rp>(</rp><rt>ば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどこですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">卫生室在哪里?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">映像</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えいぞう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">屏幕上的图像；画面（如电视画面）；视频；影片；画面；倒影；映像；脑海中的图像；心象；意象</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212216\">その<ruby>映像<rp>(</rp><rt>えいぞう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はピントがあっていない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">图像没有焦点 。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">英文</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えいぶん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">英文；英文句子；英文文本；英国文学；英文文学</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109619\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>英文<rp>(</rp><rt>えいぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>手紙<rp>(</rp><rt>てがみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしりません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不会用英文写信</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">英雄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えいゆう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">英雄；英雌；伟人；英雄交响曲（贝多芬，1804年）；英雄波兰舞曲（肖邦）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96305\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>英雄<rp>(</rp><rt>えいゆう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として<ruby>崇拝<rp>(</rp><rt>すうはい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们崇拜他为英雄。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">栄養</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えいよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">营养；营养成分</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222368\">この<ruby>魚<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>安<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くてしかも<ruby>栄養<rp>(</rp><rt>えいよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这鱼很便宜,但营养很好</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">英和</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えいわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">英日（双语）；英和词典；英日词典</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ええ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">是的；对；没错；嗯；呃；那个；咦；什么；哎；唉；怎么又是我；好；好的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202181\">「テニスをしましょうか」「ええ」</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">&quot;我们打网球吧&quot; &quot;是的&quot;</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ええと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">嗯；那个；呃；额</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227990\">ええと、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はジョギングはよいと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我觉得慢跑很好</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">笑顔</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えがお</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">笑脸；微笑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96980\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>笑顔<rp>(</rp><rt>えがお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>迎<rp>(</rp><rt>むか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてくれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们笑着迎接我</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">描く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動