/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">阅览；浏览；审阅；（网页）浏览</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">エネルギー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">能量；力气；精力；干劲；能源；能源资源；食物热量；卡路里</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121890\"><ruby>熱<rp>(</rp><rt>ねつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はエネルギーの<ruby>一種<rp>(</rp><rt>いっしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">热量是一种能量。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">絵の具</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えのぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">绘画颜料；色彩材料；颜色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142278\"><ruby>赤<rp>(</rp><rt>あか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>具<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>青<rp>(</rp><rt>あお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>具<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>混<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぜなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把红色涂料和蓝色涂料混在一起</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">エプロン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">围裙；机坪；停机坪；舞台前区；伸出式舞台</span>