=\"v-m\">选择</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きな<ruby>色<rp>(</rp><rt>いろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>選<rp>(</rp><rt>えら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请选喜欢的颜色。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">襟</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">衣领；翻领；颈带；颈部；颈后；后颈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92566\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのメダルをピンで<ruby>襟<rp>(</rp><rt>えり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にとめた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她用钉子绑了领奖章</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">得る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">える</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">获得；赚取；取得；获取；获胜；理解；领会；明白；遭受；患上（不良的事物如惩罚、疾病等）；能够；可以</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123404\"><ruby>読書<rp>(</rp><rt>どくしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からくつろぎを<ruby>得<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有些人通过阅读放松。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">エレガント</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">优雅的；高雅的；典雅的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"3375549\">なんてエレガントなヨットなんでしょう！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">多么优雅的游艇!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">エレベーター</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">电梯；升降机；（飞机的）升降舵</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227886\">エレベーターはどこですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">电梯在哪里？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/351255\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">円</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">日元；圆；圆形</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160305\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのレコードを<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うのに３０００<ruby>円<rp>(</rp><rt>えん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我花了三千日元买下唱片</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">園</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">园；果园；公园；种植园；幼儿园；托儿所；学前班</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塩</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词